title: "How Targeted Is the Preeclampsia Diagnosis Hub? Code, pre-registration and results"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered test of whether four MLP neurons in Qwen3-32B, described as a preeclampsia "diagnosis hub",
  track the diagnosis across 120 clinical cases and 40 sentences, against activation-matched random neurons.
